/p>\n          <p>\n            Tim kami terdiri dari insinyur bersertifikat, ahli teknologi, dan profesional\n            pengadaan yang siap mendukung pertumbuhan bisnis Anda.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section id=\"produk\" class=\"catalog\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <h2>Katalog Produk L</h2>\n      <p class=\"subtitle\">Solusi lengkap untuk industri modern.</p>\n\n      <div class=\"product-grid\" id=\"product-grid\">\n        <!-- Populated by products.js -->\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section id=\"kontak\" class=\"contact\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <h2>Hubungi Kami</h2>\n      <div class=\"contact-grid\">\n        <form id=\"contact-form\" class=\"contact-form\">\n          <input type=\"text\" name=\"nama\" placeholder=\"Nama Lengkap\" required />\n          <input type=\"email\" name=\"email\" placeholder=\"Email\" required />\n          <input type=\"text\" name=\"perusahaan\" placeholder=\"Nama Perusahaan\" required />\n          <textarea name=\"pesan\" placeholder=\"Pesan Anda\" rows=\"5\" required></textarea>\n          <button type=\"submit\">Kirim Pesan</button>\n        </form>\n        <div class=\"contact-info\">\n          <p><strong>Alamat:</strong><br>Jl. Contoh No. 1, Jakarta 10110, Indonesia</p>\n          <p><strong>Telepon:</strong><br>+62 21 5555 1234</p>\n          <p><strong>Email:</strong><br>info@ptcontoh.co.id</p>\n          <p><strong>Jam Kerja:</strong><br>Senin - Jumat, 08.00 - 17.00 WIB</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div id=\"form-status\" class=\"form-status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <footer class=\"footer\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <p>&copy; 2024 PT Contoh. Semua hak dilindungi undang-undang.</p>\n    </div>\n  </footer>\n\n  <script src=\"products.js\"></script>\n  <script src=\"app.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n"},"started_at":"2026-10-06T19:24:39.952Z"},"result":{"call